        :motoi "animation/set-reflow-policy")
  (verb :sakura "apply-markdown" :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "Markdown-to-attributed-string. If retained as a general
                text primitive it fits Motoi text/. If Curator-specific
                (card content pipeline), DROP.")
  (verb :sakura "ctx-get"        :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "Context-parameter reader. If R7RS parameterize-style,
                belongs in Motoi core. If Curator card-context,
                DROP. Alfred call.")
  (verb :sakura "ctx-result"     :disposition AMBIGUOUS :notes "See ctx-get.")
  (verb :sakura "ctx-set"        :disposition AMBIGUOUS :notes "See ctx-get.")
  (verb :sakura "define-form"    :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "Reads generic (define a form). If it's the same shape as
                the form/* ADD-TO-MOTOI cluster above (top-10 #4), it
                should MAP to form/define. Alfred call — likely MAP.")
  (verb :sakura "dot-count"      :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "Count dots on a surface. Could MAP to grid/count-live if
                that existed; currently no direct Motoi analog. Likely
                DROP unless Alfred wants a grid-live-count generic.")
  (verb :sakura "field"          :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "Extremely generic name. Could be a form field, a physics
                field (ai/flow-field?), or a data-record field. Needs
                context inspection per-pair. Alfred call.")
  (verb :sakura "motion-anchor-to-input" :disposition MAP
        :motoi "motion/anchor-to-input"
        :notes "Safe dashed<->slashed alias — mechanical.")
  (verb :sakura "motion-follow-input"    :disposition MAP
        :motoi "motion/follow-input")
  (verb :sakura "motion-halt"            :disposition MAP
        :motoi "motion/halt")
  (verb :sakura "motion-move-to"         :disposition MAP
        :motoi "motion/move-to")
  (verb :sakura "rule-conway"            :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "Named rule for grid step. If Motoi ever exposes a rule
                parameter to grid-step it fits; today it doesn't. Likely
                DROP.")
  (verb :sakura "set-dot-alpha"          :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "Set alpha on drawn dot. No Motoi grid/dot alpha param
                today. If Alfred wants alpha support in grid/dot, MAP;
                else DROP.")
  (verb :sakura "set-dot-color"          :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "See set-dot-alpha.")
  (verb :sakura "set-dot-radius"         :disposition AMBIGUOUS
        :notes "See set-dot-alpha."))

